101
01:04:54,763 --> 01:05:01,063
ほんの小さな
Just a tiny...

102
01:05:01,600 --> 01:05:02,860
王 僕らの king world
Oh, our king world

103
01:05:02,860 --> 01:05:05,940
アイノウ 僕らの true な 世界
I know, our true world

104
01:05:05,940 --> 01:05:06,120
諦めの街で
In a town of resignation,

105
01:05:06,120 --> 01:05:08,010
愛しいと進む
moving forward with affection,

106
01:05:08,010 --> 01:05:11,190
苦しい時も
even through painful times,

107
01:05:11,190 --> 01:05:14,300
もう私は ひとりじゃないから
because I'm no longer alone.

108
01:05:14,300 --> 01:05:19,771
だからもっと夢を追いかけたい
That's why I want to chase my dreams even more,

109
01:05:19,771 --> 01:05:23,761
ワクワクとまらない 鼓動を越えてく
beating with unstoppable excitement, transcending my heartbeat

110
01:05:23,761 --> 01:05:28,051
世界に手を出してあげる
and reaching out to the world!

111
01:05:28,051 --> 01:05:31,911
アクセスしてみたい
I want to try accessing it,

112
01:05:31,911 --> 01:05:41,011
後悔なんてさせない それぞれ違った心で
never letting you regret it, with our own unique hearts,

113
01:05:41,011 --> 01:05:43,011
走れよ
run!

114
01:05:49,291 --> 01:05:53,771
青空に輝く 眩しい想いは
The dazzling feelings shining in the blue sky

115
01:05:53,771 --> 01:05:57,191
見たことのない光を
are lights I've never seen before,

116
01:05:57,191 --> 01:06:00,811
リアルに届けるよ
delivered to reality.

117
01:06:00,811 --> 01:06:05,461
いつも聞こえるエールは ここにキャプチャして
Always capturing the cheers I hear right here,

118
01:06:05,461 --> 01:06:11,091
また新しい光を探したくなるよ
making me want to search for a new light once again.

119
01:06:11,411 --> 01:06:14,711
君の笑顔は
Your smile

120
01:06:14,711 --> 01:06:17,331
奔走して進む
rushing forward as I go,

121
01:06:17,331 --> 01:06:20,421
悲しい時に振り返るよ
looking back on sad times.

122
01:06:20,971 --> 01:06:24,511
汐風が吹くから
because the sea breeze blows!

123
01:06:25,551 --> 01:06:31,311
胸を張って夢を追いかけたい 奇跡のストーリー
Standing tall and chasing my dreams in this miraculous story,

124
01:06:31,311 --> 01:06:37,361
一緒につくろう 終わらない夢を 誰ひとり欠かせない
let's create together an endless dream where no one is left behind.

125
01:06:37,361 --> 01:06:42,711
愛が重なるこの世界 それぞれ違った心で
In this world where our love overlaps, with our own unique hearts,

126
01:06:42,711 --> 01:06:49,841
色飾れ
let's color it!

127
01:07:01,491 --> 01:07:05,291
悲しい時も 寂しい時も
Even in sad times, even in lonely times,

128
01:07:05,291 --> 01:07:11,661
気持ち信じ合えるものがある 忘れずにこの頃を
there is something we can believe in together—never forgetting these days,

129
01:07:11,661 --> 01:07:16,511
鳴らし続けたい 終わらない世界に
I want to keep ringing them out into this endless world,

130
01:07:16,511 --> 01:07:23,891
溢れ出すよ 笑顔たち
overflowing with our smiles!

131
01:07:25,791 --> 01:07:31,351
憧れの舞台たち らししく輝きたい
On the stage of our dreams, I want to shine like myself.

132
01:07:31,851 --> 01:07:37,161
時に涙して また笑い合いたい
Sometimes shedding tears, yet wanting to laugh together again.

133
01:07:37,511 --> 01:07:42,991
同じ未来も見たい あの夢手にしたい
I want to see that same future, I want to hold that dream in my hands.

134
01:07:43,311 --> 01:07:48,311
踏み出すぞ 奇跡の 一歩を
Step forward, take that miraculous step!

135
01:07:50,251 --> 01:07:53,491
息切らして夢を追いかけたい
Catching my breath, I want to chase my dreams,

136
01:07:53,491 --> 01:07:56,491
ワクワクとまらない
with unstoppable excitement,

137
01:07:56,491 --> 01:08:01,411
鼓動を越えてく 世界に手を出してあげる
transcending my heartbeat and reaching out to the world!

138
01:08:01,591 --> 01:08:03,831
アクセスしてみたい
I want to try accessing it,

139
01:08:03,831 --> 01:08:07,791
後悔なんてここにない それぞれ違った心で
with a unique heart, with no regrets whatsoever.

140
01:08:07,791 --> 01:08:13,261
作ろう
Let's create it!

141
01:08:45,411 --> 01:08:47,491
そう、お待たせいたしました！
Yes, thank you for waiting!

142
01:08:47,491 --> 01:08:52,551
ここからはスーパー白上タイム 略してSSCのお出ましだー！
From here on is Super Shirakami Corn time, abbreviated as SSC!

143
01:08:57,511 --> 01:08:59,431
ここ狐？
A fox here?

144
01:08:59,431 --> 01:09:01,211
私は白上フブキです！
I am Shirakami Fubuki!

145
01:09:01,211 --> 01:09:04,231
お歌と踊りとゲームが大好きオタクのバーチャル狐です！
A virtual fox otaku who loves singing, dancing, and gaming!

146
01:09:04,451 --> 01:09:10,621
いろんなことして狭まいに楽しく活動してるのでふぶちゃんフブキ白上皆さんお好きに呼んでください！
I'm active in all sorts of fun ways, so please feel free to call me Fubuki-chan, Fubuki, Shirakami, whatever you like!

147
01:09:11,191 --> 01:09:14,231
今日が初めての人も
To those experiencing this for the first time today,

148
01:09:14,231 --> 01:09:17,411
いつも観てくれてる人も
and those who always watch me,

149
01:09:17,911 --> 01:09:23,691
一人一人の力で私はここにいます！
I am here thanks to the power of each and every one of you!

150
01:09:30,491 --> 01:09:34,911
そう今日もずっと変わらないこの場所で
Yes, even today, in this unchanging place,

151
01:09:35,251 --> 01:09:39,761
君に1対手を差し伸べて
I'll reach out my hand to you one-on-one,

152
01:09:40,191 --> 01:09:43,711
まだまだ見ぬ世界中
into a world we haven't seen yet.

153
01:09:43,711 --> 01:09:49,111
川渡したくすぎる日々は宝物ですよ
Days rushing by so fast are truly treasures!

154
01:09:49,431 --> 01:09:53,491
泣いたって寄り添ってたいすぐ隣
Even if you cry, I want to stay close by your side,

155
01:09:53,491 --> 01:09:59,511
笑顔で一緒にハイハイそうこころをふたり重ねて届け
smiling together, stacking our hearts and delivering it to you!

156
01:10:09,211 --> 01:10:11,921
ほーっと ひと息 お茶 ですよ (はい、どーぞ!)
Take a breath, it's tea time! (Here you go!)

157
01:10:12,221 --> 01:10:14,971
いつもの 場所 から 元気 にせーの で ご挨拶
Greeting everyone cheerfully from our usual place!

158
01:10:15,061 --> 01:10:16,621
おっはこーん ですよー!
Good morning-con!

159
01:10:16,621 --> 01:10:17,901
始めましょう!
Let's get started!

160
01:10:18,100 --> 01:10:21,570
おしゃべり をして ゲーム と 過ごす そんな 毎 日 が 愛しく て
Chatting and playing games, everyday life is so dear...

161
01:10:21,670 --> 01:10:23,670
あれも これも 手 を 出し たく なり がち です
I tend to want to try everything out.

162
01:10:23,820 --> 01:10:26,070
歌 とか ステージ は まだまだ 恥ずかしい けど
Singing and stages are still a bit embarrassing, but...

163
